{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Bookmark Read Later 是一款為 iPhone、iPad 及 Mac 用戶而設的個人書籤管理工具，可集中收藏來自不同 App 的連結，並以資料夾、標籤及智能規則整理，配合去除廣告與雜亂內容的閱讀模式。本次終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $15.99，適合經常收藏文章、影片與開發專案的人士。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-124.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>收藏整理與專注閱讀</h2>\n<p>用戶可從 Safari、Chrome 或任何 App 分享連結到 Bookmark Read Later，系統會自動辨識文章、影片與 GitHub 專案等類型，並透過智能規則自動分類。內建資料夾、彩色標籤與全文搜尋方便整理；閱讀器可去除廣告及雜亂版面，筆記模式支援標記段落與記錄想法，iCloud 同步則讓 iPhone、iPad 及 Mac 保持一致。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-116-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-117-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-118-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-119-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-120-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Bookmark Read Later – Linkjoy 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Bookmark Read Later – Linkjoy</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6761393385\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.536041+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":531,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T20:23:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:03.577690+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.844850+00:00","content_hash":"7ac01bb6ac4646c647239c628cf4aa0608a863ae454b8fc0aa4e279f873bbe70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}